**Resume Builder Professional Edition**

A powerful, feature-rich resume building application designed to help professionals create, manage, and export professional resumes with ease.

**Features:**
- Multiple resume profiles with advanced management
- Industry-specific templates and customization options
- Real-time preview with multiple themes and fonts
- Advanced tools: Quality checker, ATS compatibility, keyword analysis
- Export to PDF, DOCX, and DOC formats
- Achievement quantification and professional suggestions
- Auto-save functionality with version history

**Built with:**
- HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript ES6+
- Tailwind CSS for modern, responsive design
- Font Awesome for professional icons
- html2pdf for high-quality document generation

**Contact & Support:**
- GitHub Repository: https://github.com/resume-builder-pro
- Documentation: Available in-app help system
- Community: Open source contributions welcome

